{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02510","headline":"赋得春莺送友人 · 刘孝孙","name":"赋得春莺送友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流莺拂绣羽，二月上林期。\n待雪消金禁，衔花向玉墀。\n翅掩飞燕舞，啼恼婕妤悲。\n料取金闺意，因君问所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘孝孙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}